+- `editing-controls.feature:27` — todomvc-common base stylesheet file exists
+- `editing-controls.feature:30` — todomvc-app-css contains `li.editing .view` rule
+
+**Crew targets:**
+1. Add `todomvc-app-css` and `todomvc-common` as dependencies in `package.json` and install them
+2. Guard `todoList.removeChild()` in `js/app.js` with a `parentNode` check to prevent errors when blur fires on a detached edit input after empty-edit removal
+3. Investigate DOM node stability issue where uncompleting a todo affects sibling nodes' `completed` class
 
